<title>USA: NationsBank names post-merger vice chairman.</title>
<headline>NationsBank names post-merger vice chairman.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBank Corp said Tuesday that Gregory Curl will be named vice chairman of corporate development when its merger with Boatmen's Bancshares Inc is completed.</p>
<p>Curl currently is vice chairman of Boatmen's Bancshares.</p>
<p>NationsBank said in September that it would pay $9.46 billion for Boatmen's, a St. Louis-based franchise. Shareholders of both companies plan to vote on the deal in December.</p>
